WEBVTT

00:08.800 --> 00:15.410
<b>Picking up the yesterday
that someone threw away</b>

00:15.410 --> 00:18.750
<b>I just reached my hand
out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.750 --> 00:22.050
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.050 --> 00:27.490
<b>No matter what I get, I
won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.690 --> 00:34.630
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:36.700
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:41.940
<b>I hear your voice
in the rusted time</b>

00:41.940 --> 00:44.970
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.970 --> 00:48.240
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.240 --> 00:51.850
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.850 --> 00:55.510
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.060 --> 01:08.100
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.100 --> 01:13.340
<b>I search for myself
in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.340 --> 01:16.440
<b>I want to seize it
with my own hands</b>

01:16.440 --> 01:19.670
<b>You are waiting, no
matter where I am</b>

01:19.670 --> 01:23.250
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.250 --> 01:25.910
<b>Right away</b>

01:35.390 --> 01:39.160
<b>Goku, please don't go too
quickly and drop the food.</b>

01:40.030 --> 01:41.500
<b>Got it! I'm going on ahead.</b>

01:42.300 --> 01:43.760
<b>Oops!</b>

01:45.870 --> 01:46.970
<b>Brat!</b>

01:46.970 --> 01:47.370
<b>There's nothing wrong with that.
Brat!</b>

01:47.370 --> 01:48.430
<b>There's nothing wrong with that.</b>

01:49.100 --> 01:51.470
<b>He's probably just worried
about how Sanzo's doing.</b>

01:52.440 --> 01:54.200
<b>The devil meets his match?</b>

01:57.380 --> 01:59.110
<b>The rain has been long.</b>

02:06.590 --> 02:07.360
<b>Rain</b>

02:07.360 --> 02:08.860
<b>Rain
"Rain"</b>

02:08.860 --> 02:12.350
<b>Rain</b>

02:20.240 --> 02:21.860
<b>Sanzo, you awake?</b>

02:22.970 --> 02:26.030
<b>What the heck? You
haven't been lying down?</b>

02:27.140 --> 02:28.940
<b>Quit smoking, okay?</b>

02:28.940 --> 02:31.280
<b>Oh, and I bought cough drops.</b>

02:32.180 --> 02:35.050
<b>Also, a mask and a can of peaches.</b>

02:35.620 --> 02:37.080
<b>Hey, hey, want to eat it now?</b>

02:39.350 --> 02:41.190
<b>I ain't sick.</b>

02:44.290 --> 02:47.780
<b>But you don't exactly look healthy.</b>

02:54.340 --> 02:56.700
<b>I told you not to smoke!</b>

02:57.270 --> 02:59.740
<b>More importantly,
do you have a fever?</b>

03:10.120 --> 03:12.020
<b>I said, I ain't sick.</b>

03:12.550 --> 03:14.660
<b>But then, what is it?!</b>

03:14.660 --> 03:18.730
<b>You don't eat, you don't talk,
and you've been acting weird.</b>

03:18.730 --> 03:21.750
<b>What's wrong? If there's
a reason, tell me!</b>

03:22.400 --> 03:24.130
<b>It's got nothing to do with you.</b>

03:25.270 --> 03:26.890
<b>Yes, it does.</b>

03:29.670 --> 03:32.010
<b>Come on, seriously, what's wrong?</b>

03:32.010 --> 03:34.870
<b>Did I do something to
make you mad, Sanzo?</b>

03:36.780 --> 03:37.980
<b>Shut up.</b>

03:37.980 --> 03:38.280
<b>What did you say?
Shut up.</b>

03:38.280 --> 03:39.750
<b>What did you say?</b>

03:45.420 --> 03:47.160
<b>Get out.</b>

03:47.160 --> 03:50.990
<b>What the heck? I'm
worried about you.</b>

03:52.730 --> 03:54.190
<b>Who asked you to be?</b>

03:55.530 --> 03:57.120
<b>I said, get out!</b>

04:07.610 --> 04:09.080
<b>Goku?</b>

04:16.380 --> 04:17.620
<b>Hey, monkey!</b>

04:17.620 --> 04:17.890
<b>Where are you...
Hey, monkey!</b>

04:17.890 --> 04:19.080
<b>Where are you...</b>

04:34.670 --> 04:39.230
<b>It happens all the time.
Just leave him alone.</b>

04:40.740 --> 04:42.680
<b>I did think that too,</b>

04:46.050 --> 04:48.740
<b>but we can't just leave
him alone either.</b>

05:02.000 --> 05:05.090
<b>If only the rain would let up soon.</b>

05:05.770 --> 05:07.740
<b>Then you'd feel better, right?</b>

05:08.600 --> 05:10.540
<b>Don't treat me like I'm sick.</b>

05:11.610 --> 05:13.380
<b>I know.</b>

05:13.380 --> 05:14.840
<b>Because I'm like that too.</b>

05:25.590 --> 05:28.420
<b>What's with his attitude?
So, I'm just a...</b>

05:30.330 --> 05:32.190
<b>You alone, Son Goku?</b>

05:33.130 --> 05:34.760
<b>Go away!</b>

05:34.760 --> 05:37.670
<b>I'm in a really bad mood right now!</b>

05:37.670 --> 05:39.130
<b>Really?</b>

05:42.800 --> 05:45.030
<b>I'll kill you for real.
I'm warning you.</b>

05:45.670 --> 05:48.540
<b>You look like you're about to cry.
Did you get bullied?</b>

05:50.010 --> 05:51.480
<b>Shut up!</b>

06:08.200 --> 06:10.360
<b>If you feel you can eat,
please do so.</b>

06:11.170 --> 06:13.190
<b>I'll come later to get the dishes.</b>

06:46.770 --> 06:48.960
<b>You're weak, too weak.</b>

06:49.600 --> 06:51.040
<b>Bastard!</b>

06:57.380 --> 06:59.310
<b>What's the matter, Son Goku?</b>

06:59.310 --> 07:02.180
<b>This is nothing compared to what
your real power used to be.</b>

07:07.720 --> 07:10.350
<b>Recall your true form...</b>

07:12.060 --> 07:14.430
<b>Seiten Taisei Son Goku.</b>

07:30.710 --> 07:33.370
<b>That stupid monkey never came back?</b>

07:34.920 --> 07:36.380
<b>It seems that way.</b>

07:38.750 --> 07:40.240
<b>The rain's not stopping.</b>

07:43.120 --> 07:44.530
<b>Gojyo?</b>

07:44.530 --> 07:44.630
<b>Cigarettes.
Gojyo?</b>

07:44.630 --> 07:45.860
<b>Cigarettes.</b>

07:45.860 --> 07:46.030
<b>Cigarettes.
But we still have cigarettes.</b>

07:46.030 --> 07:47.700
<b>But we still have cigarettes.</b>

07:47.700 --> 07:49.720
<b>I'm picky about my brands.</b>

08:41.320 --> 08:45.150
<b>If this place had been
deep within the earth,</b>

08:49.120 --> 08:51.680
<b>I wouldn't have
yearned for the sun.</b>

09:00.740 --> 09:02.200
<b>Are you awake?</b>

09:08.240 --> 09:09.680
<b>You bastard!</b>

09:21.560 --> 09:23.680
<b>Make sure to grit your teeth now.</b>

09:29.360 --> 09:31.200
<b>Damn you!</b>

09:32.270 --> 09:33.730
<b>What are you trying to do?!</b>

09:35.170 --> 09:36.300
<b>Nothing.</b>

09:36.300 --> 09:36.670
<b>If you're going to kill me,
then just kill me! Why...
Nothing.</b>

09:36.670 --> 09:39.610
<b>If you're going to kill me,
then just kill me! Why...</b>

09:40.410 --> 09:41.930
<b>Hey, Homura!</b>

09:46.480 --> 09:49.510
<b>Damn it! Let me go, you bastard!</b>

10:00.500 --> 10:01.960
<b>So, he got into a fight.</b>

10:03.100 --> 10:05.090
<b>You here looking for that pipsqueak?</b>

10:08.800 --> 10:09.870
<b>Give it up.</b>

10:09.870 --> 10:10.310
<b>What did you say?
Give it up.</b>

10:10.310 --> 10:11.540
<b>What did you say?</b>

10:11.540 --> 10:16.080
<b>He's not coming back.
Homura's got him.</b>

10:16.080 --> 10:20.550
<b>What's this, a party joke? It wasn't
even close to being funny.</b>

10:20.550 --> 10:22.250
<b>Why, thank you.</b>

10:22.250 --> 10:24.120
<b>What did you do with the monkey?!</b>

10:25.720 --> 10:27.190
<b>You bastard!</b>

10:38.130 --> 10:40.030
<b>He said he wouldn't be coming back?</b>

10:42.240 --> 10:45.870
<b>So at the very least, he
should still be alive.</b>

10:46.640 --> 10:48.110
<b>Probably, but...</b>

10:48.940 --> 10:50.910
<b>What are we going to do, Sanzo?</b>

10:50.910 --> 10:54.610
<b>We can't just stay here forever.</b>

10:55.350 --> 10:57.580
<b>We have to do something
about that stupid monkey.</b>

11:00.720 --> 11:02.190
<b>Sanzo?!</b>

11:03.320 --> 11:04.790
<b>Leave it.</b>

11:06.730 --> 11:09.430
<b>There's no need to go get him back.</b>

11:09.430 --> 11:10.970
<b>What's up with that?</b>

11:10.970 --> 11:13.830
<b>Are you saying Goku betrayed us?</b>

11:14.870 --> 11:16.370
<b>Betrayed?</b>

11:16.370 --> 11:19.000
<b>It's not like we promised
anything to begin with.</b>

11:19.910 --> 11:20.810
<b>Hey, now...</b>

11:20.810 --> 11:21.410
<b>We're going out to look for Goku.
Hey, now...</b>

11:21.410 --> 11:23.710
<b>We're going out to look for Goku.</b>

11:23.710 --> 11:24.980
<b>Hey...</b>

11:24.980 --> 11:25.210
<b>Sanzo, please stay here, just in
case Goku comes back.
Hey...</b>

11:25.210 --> 11:30.010
<b>Sanzo, please stay here, just in
case Goku comes back.</b>

11:31.520 --> 11:34.190
<b>I understand how you feel,</b>

11:34.190 --> 11:36.690
<b>including how you're regretting</b>

11:36.690 --> 11:39.560
<b>having lashed out at
Goku unnecessarily.</b>

11:39.560 --> 11:42.530
<b>But none of this will get
that across to anyone.</b>

11:54.840 --> 11:56.310
<b>Awake, are we?</b>

11:59.110 --> 12:00.580
<b>How's your shoulder doing?</b>

12:04.550 --> 12:06.020
<b>Here.</b>

12:07.020 --> 12:08.490
<b>Don't you want it?</b>

12:10.590 --> 12:13.860
<b>You're so stubborn. What
are you so afraid of?</b>

12:14.660 --> 12:15.760
<b>I'm not afraid!</b>

12:15.760 --> 12:16.200
<b>Then is it Sanzo you fear?
I'm not afraid!</b>

12:16.200 --> 12:18.570
<b>Then is it Sanzo you fear?</b>

12:18.570 --> 12:22.530
<b>I'm not anyone's underling, and
there's nothing I'm afraid of!</b>

12:25.310 --> 12:26.770
<b>Is that so?</b>

12:30.910 --> 12:33.310
<b>What did you think about
in Mount Gogyou?</b>

12:34.550 --> 12:37.050
<b>Did you curse the gods
who locked you away?</b>

12:37.050 --> 12:39.880
<b>Or did you laugh at yourself
for being locked up?</b>

12:40.890 --> 12:44.120
<b>Are you happy with having both your
powers and memories sealed away?</b>

13:02.140 --> 13:03.810
<b>Bastard...</b>

13:03.810 --> 13:06.710
<b>Don't you want to get it all back?</b>

13:06.710 --> 13:09.820
<b>You don't have to tell me that.
I'll do it myself.</b>

13:09.820 --> 13:12.990
<b>What if you can't get it back?</b>

13:12.990 --> 13:14.890
<b>You're a heresy, just as I am.</b>

13:15.760 --> 13:19.930
<b>A solitary, abominable existence,
the one and only in the world.</b>

13:19.930 --> 13:21.860
<b>No, I'm...</b>

13:21.860 --> 13:26.830
<b>That's why you cling to Sanzo,
seeking validation.</b>

13:26.830 --> 13:28.300
<b>No...</b>

13:29.440 --> 13:31.100
<b>What about Sanzo?</b>

13:32.340 --> 13:34.600
<b>Has he ever needed you?</b>

13:35.780 --> 13:37.710
<b>Is that how you want it to be?</b>

13:37.710 --> 13:39.180
<b>Doesn't it feel futile?</b>

13:40.550 --> 13:42.020
<b>Shut up!</b>

13:43.350 --> 13:48.120
<b>Your existence is far more
important than you think.</b>

13:49.320 --> 13:52.380
<b>Watching you, I can't help
but feel this impatience.</b>

13:53.330 --> 13:56.190
<b>I don't understand! What
do you want me to do?!</b>

13:57.830 --> 13:59.630
<b>You need not do anything.</b>

14:00.840 --> 14:03.140
<b>I'll protect you.</b>

14:03.140 --> 14:04.140
<b>What are you saying?</b>

14:04.140 --> 14:04.640
<b>I'll give you everything you desire.
What are you saying?</b>

14:04.640 --> 14:06.470
<b>I'll give you everything you desire.</b>

14:07.170 --> 14:10.310
<b>All you have to do is come to me.</b>

14:10.310 --> 14:13.910
<b>Don't be ridiculous! Like hell!
Like hell I will!</b>

14:21.520 --> 14:22.990
<b>Why?</b>

14:23.590 --> 14:26.860
<b>You'll come, won't you, Son Goku?</b>

14:30.130 --> 14:31.600
<b>I...</b>

14:34.540 --> 14:37.990
<b>Damn that monkey for making
so much trouble for us!</b>

14:39.540 --> 14:40.740
<b>What is it?</b>

14:40.740 --> 14:41.040
<b>I guess you have no
doubt in your mind.
What is it?</b>

14:41.040 --> 14:43.530
<b>I guess you have no
doubt in your mind.</b>

14:44.510 --> 14:46.910
<b>About why Goku hasn't come back.</b>

14:47.650 --> 14:51.450
<b>You seriously think Goku's
thrown in with Homura?</b>

14:51.450 --> 14:53.720
<b>No, but...</b>

14:53.720 --> 14:56.320
<b>What's there to even think about?</b>

14:57.290 --> 14:59.630
<b>That stupid monkey
doesn't have the brains</b>

14:59.630 --> 15:02.220
<b>for betrayal and shit like that.</b>

15:06.970 --> 15:09.000
<b>What a great conversation.</b>

15:09.000 --> 15:11.810
<b>You shouldn't mock them, Zenon.</b>

15:11.810 --> 15:15.340
<b>Don't mess with us! What
did you do with Goku?!</b>

15:15.340 --> 15:16.810
<b>Nothing.</b>

15:18.910 --> 15:21.620
<b>I told you, didn't I?
He's not coming back.</b>

15:21.620 --> 15:25.450
<b>And yet, here you are. How good
of you to trouble yourselves.</b>

15:25.450 --> 15:28.590
<b>I don't particularly think
of it as troublesome.</b>

15:28.590 --> 15:30.680
<b>How laudable of you.</b>

16:02.390 --> 16:05.130
<b>You're so persistent.</b>

16:05.130 --> 16:07.150
<b>I'm often told it's one
of my virtues.</b>

16:08.360 --> 16:12.600
<b>Well, virtues and flaws don't matter
much once you've croaked.</b>

16:12.600 --> 16:17.770
<b>That's why part of my charm
is not to croak so easily.</b>

16:17.770 --> 16:22.640
<b>Is that just how badly you don't wish
to lose Son Goku's strength?</b>

16:29.150 --> 16:30.690
<b>Strength?</b>

16:30.690 --> 16:33.990
<b>Don't be stupid.
He's just a monkey.</b>

16:33.990 --> 16:38.890
<b>But if you take him,
we can't play mah-jong.</b>

16:39.690 --> 16:41.690
<b>Where'd you take the stupid monkey?!</b>

16:43.360 --> 16:44.990
<b>That's none of your business!</b>

16:46.470 --> 16:47.900
<b>What did you say?!</b>

16:51.610 --> 16:53.070
<b>Gojyo!</b>

16:54.510 --> 16:55.980
<b>Hakkai!</b>

17:00.380 --> 17:01.850
<b>What?!</b>

17:13.460 --> 17:14.950
<b>Sanzo!</b>

17:18.470 --> 17:20.090
<b>I can't sleep, damn it!</b>

17:21.800 --> 17:24.430
<b>When Son Goku isn't around?</b>

17:27.580 --> 17:29.010
<b>An idle spectator?</b>

17:30.680 --> 17:32.270
<b>You're nothing but scum.</b>

17:42.260 --> 17:45.380
<b>If this place had been
deep within the earth,</b>

17:47.430 --> 17:50.920
<b>I'd never have had to know what
freedom and loneliness were.</b>

17:52.070 --> 17:53.530
<b>Wait!</b>

17:55.170 --> 17:58.100
<b>Sanzo, you don't
care about me at all!</b>

17:58.710 --> 18:00.940
<b>You don't say anything!
There's nothing there!</b>

18:00.940 --> 18:02.710
<b>Who's the mean one here?!</b>

18:02.710 --> 18:04.340
<b>Why did you take me out?!</b>

18:04.910 --> 18:07.440
<b>If it was going to be like this,
I'd rather have been left.</b>

18:16.960 --> 18:21.490
<b>I'm always the one causing
you trouble. I hate that!</b>

18:22.560 --> 18:24.500
<b>What the heck am I to you?</b>

18:24.500 --> 18:27.870
<b>What's wrong with me worrying
about you once in a while?!</b>

18:30.140 --> 18:33.040
<b>Hey, what the hell
did you tell him?</b>

18:33.910 --> 18:35.380
<b>Nothing.</b>

18:36.380 --> 18:41.210
<b>Sanzo, Son Goku needs your brilliance.</b>

18:42.750 --> 18:45.880
<b>Because it seems I can't be his sun.</b>

18:46.990 --> 18:51.950
<b>When we meet next time, I will
take him by force. Goodbye.</b>

18:55.430 --> 18:56.900
<b>Later.</b>

19:00.500 --> 19:03.840
<b>Monkey, I'm in a bad mood
because of the rain.</b>

19:03.840 --> 19:05.700
<b>Decide your own
matters for yourself.</b>

19:08.040 --> 19:09.510
<b>San...</b>

19:12.650 --> 19:16.710
<b>He led me out of that
dark place without light.</b>

19:17.650 --> 19:23.560
<b>He gave me a world much,
much brighter than the sun.</b>

19:36.900 --> 19:39.460
<b>What I wanted wasn't a servant.</b>

19:52.120 --> 19:54.680
<b>Sanzo, shall we get going soon?</b>

19:59.790 --> 20:01.260
<b>Yo!</b>

20:04.400 --> 20:06.170
<b>How far are we going today?</b>

20:06.170 --> 20:09.290
<b>I'd like to have something good
to eat, since it's been a while.</b>

20:09.870 --> 20:11.510
<b>Hey!</b>

20:11.510 --> 20:13.140
<b>Go buy cigarettes.</b>

20:13.140 --> 20:15.910
<b>Also get pickled kelp and
frozen mandarin oranges.</b>

20:15.910 --> 20:17.510
<b>Hey, why do I have to go?</b>

20:17.510 --> 20:20.250
<b>Quit complaining, or I'll kill you!</b>

20:20.250 --> 20:22.820
<b>You just said yesterday
I wasn't your servant...</b>

20:22.820 --> 20:24.520
<b>I'm going!</b>

20:24.520 --> 20:26.680
<b>Sheesh, you're so twisted.</b>

20:27.790 --> 20:29.290
<b>Who are you talking about?</b>

20:29.290 --> 20:30.760
<b>Oh, nothing.</b>

20:31.760 --> 20:33.230
<b>Hey!</b>

20:34.030 --> 20:37.050
<b>Well, at any rate, isn't it great
the weather cleared up?</b>

20:46.340 --> 20:55.150
<b>All people coming and
going carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.520 --> 21:06.920
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.260 --> 21:18.400
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:19.740 --> 21:32.720
<b>The words that pierced my
heart back then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.720 --> 21:44.160
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.160 --> 21:55.440
<b>The more I lose, the more
certain this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.440 --> 22:07.620
<b>Now, I can surely
walk on and on forever</b>
